                        <field name="dc_description">Includes half-title. -- Price from imprint: one shilling and six pence. -- Printed for J. Wilkie, St. Paul's church yard, London. -- Handwritten pagination in black ink on head of pages. -- Includes appendix containing  a table of the "Total quantities of foreign linens imported into England from Christmas 1751 to Christmas 1771".  -- Includes tables showing the "Total quantities of Irish linens exported from Ireland from March 25 1751, to March 25 1773". -- Includes a table showing the "Total quantities of Scoth linens, stamped for sale in Scotland from the 1st of Nov 1751, to the 1st of Nov 1773". -- Includes a table showing the Total quantities of Irish linens, imported into England from Christmas 1756, to Christmas 1773". -- Includes a table showing the "Total quantities of British and Irish linens exported from England and Scotland from Jan 1757, to Jan 1774, with bounties paid each year thereon". </field>
